{"id":"00006","root":"uni00006_1","name":{"ja":"心願寺　紅","en":"Shinganji Kurenai"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"心願寺　紅","en":"Shinganji Kurenai"},"element":"Devilish","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2018-09-25","limited":false,"characterId":6,"profile":{"ja":"対魔忍。吸血鬼と人間のハーフでありながら対魔忍として生きる異端の存在。祖父である“ふうま八将”心願寺幻庵から剣術の指南を受け、ゆくゆくは八将を継ぐと目されていた実力者。しかしかつての内紛でふうま宗家に助力した咎で幻庵は失脚。その跡目を継ぐはずだった紅もふうまの里を離れ、現在はどこにも属さない自由な立場で行動している。先代のふうま八将・心願寺幻庵から受け継いだ二刀の小太刀『白神』『紅魔』を所持。ハーフヴァンパイアの身体能力を活かした絶大なる戦闘能力を誇り、二刀の小太刀を高速で操ることで真空の刃を作り出す“絶技・旋風陣”を得意とする。","en":"Shinganji Kurenai is a Taimanin—a half-vampire who chooses to live as a demon-hunter. She received swordsmanship instruction from her grandfather, the Fuuma Eight-General Shinganji Gen-an, and was once slated to inherit his position. However, after the Fuuma clan fell from grace for aiding the family during an internal conflict, Kurenai left the Fuuma village and now operates as a free agent with no allegiance. She wields the twin short swords \"Shirakami\" and \"Kōma,\" passed down from the former Eight-General. Proud of her extraordinary combat prowess derived from her half-vampire physiology, she excels at the signature technique \"Whirlwind Formation,\" slicing vacuum with her rapidly-maneuvered blades."},"illustrator":"ＺＯＬ","voiceActor":"かざりゆえ","forms":[{"id":"uni00006_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1158,2317],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[173,347],"def":[132,263],"spd":[73,73],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["2","21"]},{"id":"uni00006_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1716,3432],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[271,541],"def":[189,378],"spd":[73,73],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["2","21","22"]},{"id":"uni00006_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2274,4548],"sp":[300,300],"atk":[369,738],"def":[246,492],"spd":[73,73],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["2","21","22","23"]}],"skills":{"2":{"slot":"attack",